### Reporte analitico de clientes - Sucursal 01 Mexico
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/accounts-receivable/clients/reports/analytics?status=active&risk=all&page=1&pageSize=25
Accept: application/json

### Reporte analitico - buscar y mostrar solo riesgo critico
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/accounts-receivable/clients/reports/analytics?q=industrial&status=active&risk=critical&page=1&pageSize=25
Accept: application/json
